-- Catch-up for schema changes that reached production through `prisma db push`
-- and never got a migration. Without it a database built from migrations alone
-- fails at 20261009110000_commerce_seo_notifications. Generated by diffing a migrations-only database against
-- prisma/schema.prisma, excluding anything a later migration adds itself.
--
-- Databases that already have these columns (anything created with db push)
-- must mark this migration as applied instead of running it:
--   npx prisma migrate resolve --applied 20261009105959_catch_up_db_push_drift
